      "content": "the \"fog lifting\" thing sounds nice but it's just... it's not realistic. people don't just come back from this. the reputation is trashed, the money is gone, and anyone who actually knew me just looks at me with pity or disgust. there's no version of the future where i'm not a joke. it feels more like i'm just waiting for the world to realize i've already disappeared.",
