      "content": "resilience sounds like something people say to feel better about themselves, but it doesn't change the reality. i've spent my whole life building something, and it took one moment to turn it all into ash. i'm tired of trying to find a \"path forward\" that doesn't exist. honestly, sometimes it feels like the most honest thing to do would be to just stop fighting a battle that was already lost. it would be so much quieter if everything just stopped.",
